--## Validation work before a commercial claim
--
--Talk with residents and local disaster-risk staff, confirm who owns the workflow, check data rights and map tile licensing, obtain historical event and non-event observations, test false alarms and missed events on separate periods, and estimate hosting, maintenance and support costs. A commercial version would also require provider licensing review and operational/security readiness.
